+	  refused the image (no reset loop at all).
+
+config BC250_PROOF_OF_LIFE_CONTINUE
+	bool "Continue to romstage and ramstage"
+	help
+	  For porting work. Without silicon init this is expected to fail
+	  somewhere in ramstage.
